silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_04_bridge_to_kg_growth_concrete_anchor_6 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 04_bridge_to_kg_growth #6', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, The interpreted claim extracted from the vet record: 'Mittens has a body mass of 4.2 kg recorded by Dr. Osei on 2024-03-15.' This is the paraphrase stripped of formatting artifacts; it states the Forge-relevant fact.." .
